364:
The following shall be a violation of this article:
(1) The sounding of any horn or signaling device on any automobile, motorcycle or other vehicle on any street or public place in the city except as a danger warning;
(2) The creation of any unreasonably loud or harsh sound by means of any such signaling device and the sounding of any such device for an unreasonable period of time;
(3) The use of any signaling device, except a police whistle or one operated by hand or electricity;
